{'symbol': 'MCD', 'date': '2019-10-29 22:30:00', 'title': "MCDONALD'S PLANS TO INVEST EUR 5.2 MILLION IN DEVELOPMENT IN LATVIA IN COMING THREE YEARS", 'text': "MCDONALD'S RESTAURANT CHAIN IN THE COMING THREE YEARS PLANS TO INVEST EUR 5.2 MILLION IN DEVELOPMENT IN LATVIA, THE COMPANY'S EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR IN THE BALTIC STATES, VLADIMIRS JANEVSKIS. THE COMPANY ALSO PLANS TO UPGRADE MCDRIVE, IMPROVING THE SERVICE QUALITY AND OPENING TWO NEW MCDRIVE PLACES."}